[I] A terminal for a container-oriented desktop

[T] Ptyxis is a GTK 4 terminal emulator for GNOME based on VTE, with
[T] first-class support for containers such as Podman, Toolbox and
[T] Distrobox. It features tabs, profiles and a modern libadwaita interface.

[U] https://devsuite.app/ptyxis/

